cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the accompanying manuscript when using this code and data."
title: "A Bi-objective Priority-Weighted Latency Location-Routing Problem for Pharmaceutical Distribution"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility archive for a bi-objective priority-weighted latency
  location-routing problem for pharmaceutical distribution. It contains the
  GRASP-VND-SO heuristic, the exact method (commodity-flow MILP and
  branch-and-price), de-identified manuscript-aligned instances (clean CSVs with
  no coordinates, real identifiers or sales), and stored heuristic and exact
  results (anchors, routes and anchor-normalized augmented weighted Tchebycheff
  production curves).
type: software
version: "1.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-29"
